<title>FAROE ISLANDS: SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA ROUT FAROES 8-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA ROUT FAROES 8-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TOFTIR, Faroe Islands 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia beat the Faroe Islands 8-1 (5-1) in their World Cup European group six qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Faroe Islands - Jan Mueller (26th)</p>
<p>Yugoslavia - Savo Milosevic (7th, 36th, 45th), Slavisa Jokanovic (10th, 57th), Paedrag Mijatovic (30th), Vladimir Jugovic (68th), Dragan Stojkovic (90th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,017  </p>
<p>Group six standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Yugoslavia	     3   3   0   0  17   2   9</p>
<p> Slovakia		 2   2   0   0   8   1   6</p>
<p> Czech Republic	 1   1   0   0   6   0   3</p>
<p> Spain		    1   1   0   0   6   2   3</p>
<p> Faroe Islands	  4   0   0   4   5  19   0</p>
<p> Malta		    3   0   0   3   0  18   0</p>
<p>Next match: Oct 9 - Czech Republic v Spain</p>
</text>
